<doc id="183179" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183179" title="Kabiskopan Agung Taunggyi">
Kabiskopan Agung Taunggyi

Kabiskopan Agung Taunggyi (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Archidiœcesis Taunggyiensis) ana ing &lt;a href="Negara%20Bagean%20Shan"&gt;Negara Bagean Shan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Myanmar"&gt;Myanmar&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan-kabiskopan &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Kengtung"&gt;Kengtung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Loikaw"&gt;Loikaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Pekhon"&gt;Pekhon&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Taungngu"&gt;Taungngu&lt;/a&gt; menika sufragan saka kabiskopan agung kasebut. Katedral kabiskopan agung kasebut menika Katedral Santo Yusuf ing &lt;a href="Taunggyi"&gt;Taunggyi&lt;/a&gt;.
