<h3>Vikaris Apostolik Burma Wetan</h3>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Eugenio%20Biffi"&gt;Eugenio Biffi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Institut%20Kepausan%20Misi%20Asing"&gt;P.I.M.E.&lt;/a&gt; (1867 – 7 Februari 1882, diangkat dadi &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung%20Cartagena"&gt;Biskop Cartagena&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<ul>
<li>Sede vacante (7 Februari – 12 Februari 1882)</li>
</ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Tancredi%20Conti"&gt;Tancredi Conti&lt;/a&gt; (12 Februari 1882 – 26 November 1889, ora dimangerteni sebabe masa jabatane rampung)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Rocco%20Tornatore"&gt;Rocco Tornatore&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Institut%20Kepausan%20Misi%20Asing"&gt;M.E.M.&lt;/a&gt; (26 November 1889 – 26 Januari 1908, seda)</li>
<ul>
<li>Sede vacante (26 Januari – 18 Mei 1908)</li>
</ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Emmanuel%20Segrada"&gt;Emmanuel Segrada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Institut%20Kepausan%20Misi%20Asing"&gt;P.I.M.E.&lt;/a&gt; (18 Mei 1908 – 27 April 1927, dadi Vikaris Apostolik Toungoo)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Vikaris Apostolik Toungoo</h3>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Emmanuel%20Segrada"&gt;Emmanuel Segrada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Institut%20Kepausan%20Misi%20Asing"&gt;P.I.M.E.&lt;/a&gt; (27 April 1927 – 1936, pensiun)</li>
