<doc id="183251" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183251" title="Mesjid Lala Mustafa Pasha">
Mesjid Lala Mustafa Pasha

Mesjid Lala Mustafa Pasha (&lt;a href="Basa%20Grikenlan"&gt;Grikenlan&lt;/a&gt;: Τέμενος Λαλά Μουσταφά Πασά Temenos Lalá Moustaphá Pasá, &lt;a href="basa%20Basa%20Turki"&gt;Basa Turki&lt;/a&gt;: Lala Mustafa Paşa Camii), biyen dikenal minangka Katedral Santo Nikolas lan banjur kuwi minangka Mesjid Santa Sofia (Ayasofya) Mağusa, yaiku bangunan abad pertengahan paling gedhe ing &lt;a href="Famagusta"&gt;Famagusta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Siprus"&gt;Siprus&lt;/a&gt;. Dibangun saka 1298 nganti kira-kira 1400, bangunan kasebut ditahbiskake dadi &lt;a href="katedral"&gt;katedral&lt;/a&gt; Katulik ing 1328. Katedral kasebut diobah dadi mesjid sawise &lt;a href="Kekaisaran%20Utsmaniyah"&gt;Kekaisaran Utsmaniyah&lt;/a&gt; ngerebut Famagusta ing 1571 lan isih dadi mesjid nganti saiki. Sawise 1954, bangunan kasebut njupuk jeneng saka &lt;a href="Lala%20Mustafa%20Pasha"&gt;Lala Mustafa Pasha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Vizier%20Agung"&gt;Vizier Agung&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kekaisaran%20Utsmaniyah"&gt;Kekaisaran Utsmaniyah&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Sokolovi%C4%87i%2C%20Sokolac"&gt;Sokolovići&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Bosni"&gt;Bosni&lt;/a&gt;, sing ngelayani &lt;a href="Murat%20III"&gt;Murat III&lt;/a&gt; lan mimpin pasukan Utsmaniyah ngelawan &lt;a href="Venesia"&gt;Venesia&lt;/a&gt; ing Siprus.
