<doc id="183279" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183279" title="Bob chorba">
Bob chorba

Bob chorba (basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Bulgari"&gt;Bulgari&lt;/a&gt;: ; lit. "bean soup") yaiku salah sawijining jinis olahan &lt;a href="chorba"&gt;chorba&lt;/a&gt;, sup &lt;a href="Bulgari"&gt;Bulgaria&lt;/a&gt;. Iki digawe saka kacang buncis garing, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="tomat"&gt;tomat&lt;/a&gt;, chubritza utawa dzhodzhen (spearmint) lan &lt;a href="Wortel%20jangan"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt;. 
Variasi lokal bisa uga ora kalebu wortel utawa kalebu &lt;a href="paprika"&gt;paprika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt; utawa sawetara jinis daging. Sacara historis, wis dadi sup umum lan &lt;a href="panganan%20pokok"&gt;panganan pokok&lt;/a&gt; ing biara Bulgaria. 
