<doc id="183284" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183284" title="Gyeran-mari">
Gyeran-mari

Gyeran-mari (&lt;a href="Hangul"&gt;Hangul&lt;/a&gt;: 계란말이) utawa omelet gulung ing &lt;a href="Olahan%20Kor%C3%A9a"&gt;masakan Korea&lt;/a&gt; ya iku salah sawijining jinis olahan &lt;a href="banchan"&gt;banchan&lt;/a&gt; gurih (lauk) sing digawé saka endhog sing dikocok dicampur karo sawetara bahan sing dicincang sacoro apik. Bahan-bahan umum kalebu sayuran (&lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wortel%20jangan"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt;, zucchini Korea, scallions, &lt;a href="Kucai"&gt;chives bawang putih&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Jamur%20pangan"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt;, daging olahan (&lt;a href="ham"&gt;ham&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20bakon"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, daging &lt;a href="Stik%20yuyu"&gt;kepiting tiruan&lt;/a&gt;, tuna kaleng), uyah utawa panganan laut asin (&lt;a href="Pollock%20roe"&gt;asin pollock roe&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saeu-jeot"&gt;udang asin&lt;/a&gt;), lan &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt;.. Opsional, &lt;a href="gim"&gt;gim&lt;/a&gt; (rumput laut) dilebokake karo omelet. Nalika disuguhake, omelet dipotong dadi 2-3 cm irisan. Iki uga minangka anju sing umum ditemokake ing pojangmacha (warung-warung ing pinggir dalan). 
