<doc id="183289" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183289" title="California gulung">
California gulung

Gulungan California utawa maki California minangka gulungan &lt;a href="sushi"&gt;sushi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Sushi"&gt;makizushi&lt;/a&gt; sing biasane digulung ing njaba, lan ngemot &lt;a href="timun"&gt;timun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20yuyu"&gt;kepiting&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Stik%20yuyu"&gt;kepiting imitasi&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Apokat"&gt;alpukat&lt;/a&gt;. Kadhangkala salad crab diganti kanggo crab stick, lan asring lapisan njaba beras ing gulungan njero-metu (&lt;a href="Sushi"&gt;uramaki&lt;/a&gt;) disiram karo &lt;a href="Wij%C3%A8n"&gt;wijen&lt;/a&gt; panggang utawa &lt;a href="Endhog%20iwak"&gt;roe&lt;/a&gt; kayata tobiko saka iwak mabur. Minangka salah siji saka gaya paling populer sushi ing &lt;a href="Kanadha"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt;, California Roll wis pengaruh ing popularitas global sushi, lan ing inspirasi &lt;a href="Koki%20sushi"&gt;chef sushi&lt;/a&gt; ing saindhenging donya kanggo nggawe &lt;a href="Olahan%20campuran"&gt;masakan fusion&lt;/a&gt; non-tradisional. 
