<doc id="183340" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183340" title="Matsumaezuke">
Matsumaezuke

Matsumaezuke (松前漬け, Matsumaezuke) minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan saka &lt;a href="Matsumae%2C%20Hokkaido"&gt;Matsumae, Hokkaidō&lt;/a&gt; area saka &lt;a href="Hokkaido"&gt;Hokkaidō&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Japan&lt;/a&gt;.
Iki digawe saka bahan-bahan seger saka Hokkaido. Surume (cumi garing) lan &lt;a href="Kombu"&gt;konbu diusap&lt;/a&gt; nganggo kain teles banjur dipotong tipis-tipis nganggo &lt;a href="gunting"&gt;gunting&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Endhog%20iwak"&gt;Kazunoko&lt;/a&gt; (herring &lt;a href="Endhog%20iwak"&gt;roe&lt;/a&gt;) dicincang cilik, lan &lt;a href="Wortel%20jangan"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9"&gt;jahe&lt;/a&gt; disigar. Bahan kasebut banjur dicampur karo campuran &lt;a href="sake"&gt;sake&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saos%20kedhel%C3%A9"&gt;kecap&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="mirin"&gt;mirin&lt;/a&gt; sing wis digodhog. Sawetara irisan mrico abang bisa ditambahake. Campuran kasebut disimpen ing papan sing adhem seminggu sadurunge mangan.

