<doc id="183359" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183359" title="Eparki Ramanathapuram">
Eparki Ramanathapuram

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Eparki Siro-Malabar Ramanathapuram ana ing wilayah &lt;a href="Ramanathapuram%2C%20Coimbatore"&gt;Ramanathapuram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Coimbatore"&gt;Coimbatore&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tamil%20Nadu"&gt;Tamil Nadu&lt;/a&gt;. Eparki kasebut ngeliputi distrik-distrik &lt;a href="Coimbatore"&gt;Coimbatore&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tirupur"&gt;Tirupur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Erode"&gt;Erode&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Karur"&gt;Karur&lt;/a&gt;. Wilayahne diambakake nganti Salem lan Trichy ing 10-10-2017. Eparki Ramanathapuram didegake kanthi misahkene saka eparki Siro-Malabar Palghat. Biskop Ramanathapuram saiki menika Mar Paul Alappat. Greja Tritunggal Suci, Ramanathapuram menika katedral saka eparki kasebut lan kediaman biskop uga ana ing Ramanathapuram. Eparki kasebut menika sufragan saka &lt;a href="Eparki%20Agung%20Thrissur"&gt;Eparki Agung Thrissur&lt;/a&gt;.
Kabiskopan kasebut didegake dening Mar Varkey Kardinal Vithayathil, liwat dekrit tertanggal 18 Januari 2010. Eparki kasebut duwe amba 18,525&amp;nbsp;km2 karo total populasi 89, 24,717 sing endi kira-kira 15,694 menika umat Katulik Siro-Malabar.
