<doc id="183385" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183385" title="Eparki Mavelikara">
Eparki Mavelikara

Eparki Katulik Siro-Malankara Mavelikara yaiku eparki (kabiskopan) &lt;a href="suffragan"&gt;suffragan&lt;/a&gt; saka Episkopal Agung Mayor &lt;a href="Eparki%20Agung"&gt;Eparki Agung&lt;/a&gt; (Biskop Agung Metropolitan) &lt;a href="Trivandrum"&gt;Trivandrum&lt;/a&gt;, sing uga menika Biskop Agung Mayor (kepala) &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik%20Siro-Malankara"&gt;Greja Katulik Siro-Malankara&lt;/a&gt;, Greja Katulik Wetan &lt;a href="Ritus%20Antiokia"&gt;Ritus Antiokia&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;Indhi&lt;/a&gt;.
Tahtane ana ing &lt;a href="Mavelikkara"&gt;Mavelikkara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="taluk"&gt;taluk&lt;/a&gt; lan munisipalitas ing bagean kidul distrik Alappuzha, praja &lt;a href="Kerala"&gt;Kerala&lt;/a&gt;, kidul kulon India, ing tepi &lt;a href="Kali%20Achankovil"&gt;Kali Achankovil&lt;/a&gt;.
Eparki kasebut menika eparki ka-6 saka &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik%20Siro-Malankara"&gt;Greja Katulik Siro-Malankara&lt;/a&gt;, sing didegake ing 2 Januari 2007 ing wilayah sing sadurunge lumebu eparki agung Metropolitan. Eparki kasebut nduweni 94 &lt;a href="paroki"&gt;paroki&lt;/a&gt; lan 37,000 anggota. Biskop pertami saka eparki kasebut yaiku &lt;a href="Joshua%20Mar%20Ignathios"&gt;Joshua Mar Ignathios&lt;/a&gt;. Santa pelindunge yaiku Dewi Maria, sing uga dimuliake ing katedral saka eparki kasebut.
