<doc id="183456" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183456" title="Kabiskopan Agung Goa lan Daman">
Kabiskopan Agung Goa lan Daman

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Kabiskopan Agung Metropolitan Katulik Roma Goa lan Daman (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Archidioecesis Goanae et Damanensis, &lt;a href="basa%20Portugis"&gt;Portugis&lt;/a&gt;: Arquidiocese de Goa e Damão) yaiku &lt;a href="kabiskopan%20agung"&gt;kabiskopan agung&lt;/a&gt; sing ngelingkungi praja &lt;a href="Goa"&gt;Goa&lt;/a&gt;, lan Uni Teritorial &lt;a href="Daman%2C%20Daman%20lan%20Diu"&gt;Daman&lt;/a&gt; ing Indhi. &lt;a href="Provinsi%20Grejani"&gt;Provinsi Grejani&lt;/a&gt; Goa lan Daman ngeliputi kabiskopan-&lt;a href="kabiskopan%20suffragan"&gt;kabiskopan suffragan&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Sindhudurg"&gt;Kabiskopan Sindhudurg&lt;/a&gt; (Dioecesis Sindhudurgiensis) sing ngeliputi distrik &lt;a href="Sindhudurg"&gt;Sindhudurg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ratnagiri%20%28distrik%29"&gt;Ratnagiri&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kolhapur"&gt;Kolhapur&lt;/a&gt; ing praja &lt;a href="Maharashtra"&gt;Maharashtra&lt;/a&gt;, kajaba greja St. Fransiskus Xaverius ing Kutha Kolhapur. Kabiskopan Agung Sindhudurg didegake ing 5 Juli 2005, nalika kabiskopan agung kasebut misahke diri saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Poona"&gt;Kabiskopan Poona&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan kasebut menika kabiskopan suffragan saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung%20Bombay"&gt;Kabiskopan Agung Bombay&lt;/a&gt; nganti 25 November 2006, nalika Paus &lt;a href="Benediktus%20XVI"&gt;Benediktus XVI&lt;/a&gt; ngadegake provinsi Metropolitan &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung%20Goa%20e%20Dam%C3%A3o"&gt;Goa lan Damão&lt;/a&gt;.
