<doc id="183506" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183506" title="Greja Katulik Grikenlan Slowak">
Greja Katulik Grikenlan Slowak

Greja Katulik Grikenlan Slowak (&lt;a href="basa%20Slowak"&gt;Slowak&lt;/a&gt;: Gréckokatolícka cirkev na Slovensku, "Greja Katulik Grikenlan ing Slowak"; &lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Ecclesia Graeco Catholica Slovacica), utawa Greja Katulik Bizantium Slowak, yaiku &lt;a href="greja%20patrikuler"&gt;greja patrikuler&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik%20Wetan"&gt;Katulik Wetan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sui%20iuris"&gt;sui iuris&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="biskop%20metropolitan"&gt;metropolitan&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="persekutuan%20penuh"&gt;persekutuan penuh&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik"&gt;Greja Katulik&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sri%20Paus"&gt;Sri Paus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Tahta%20Suci"&gt;Roma&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Ritus%20liturgi"&gt;Ritus liturgi&lt;/a&gt;ne yaiku &lt;a href="Ritus%20Bizantium"&gt;Ritus Bizantium&lt;/a&gt;. Ing 2008 ing &lt;a href="Slowak"&gt;Slowak&lt;/a&gt; dhewe, Greja Katulik Grikenlan Slowak nduweni kira-kira 350,000 panganut, 374 imam lan 254 paroki. Ing 2017, Greja Katulik ngeklaim ana 207.320 panganut Katulik Grikenlan Slowak ing seluruh donya, ngewakili kira-kira siji persen saka kabeh panganut Katulik Wetan.
