<doc id="183507" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183507" title="Sabine Baring-Gould">
Sabine Baring-Gould

Sabine Baring-Gould (; #ALIH) yaiku pandhita &lt;a href="Anglikan"&gt;Anglikan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="hagiografer"&gt;hagiografer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="antiquarian"&gt;antiquarian&lt;/a&gt;, novelis, kolektor tembang foklor lan cendekiawan eklektik. Pratelan pustakane terdiri saka luwih saka 1.240 publikasi, sanadyan pratelan kasebut isih isa tuwuh. Omah kaluwargane, &lt;a href="omah%20manor"&gt;omah manor&lt;/a&gt; Lew Trenchard, cedhak &lt;a href="Okehampton"&gt;Okehampton&lt;/a&gt;, Devon, didegake nalika ia bangun ulang lan saiki dadi hotel. Ia dikenal minangka penulis &lt;a href="kidung"&gt;kidung&lt;/a&gt;-kidung, sing kalebu "&lt;a href="Onward%2C%20Christian%20Soldiers"&gt;Onward, Christian Soldiers&lt;/a&gt;", "Sing Lullaby", lan "Now the Day Is Over". Ia uga nerjemahke kidung Natal "&lt;a href="Gabriel%27s%20Message"&gt;Gabriel's Message&lt;/a&gt;" saka &lt;a href="basa%20Basque"&gt;basa Basque&lt;/a&gt; menyang basa Inggris.
