&lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt; sampun ngirim atlit menyang sabagean gedhe &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Panas"&gt;Olimpiade Musim Panas&lt;/a&gt; sing dianakake sawise 1948, nalika nagara kasebut didegake minangka &lt;a href="Koloni%20Mahkota"&gt;Koloni Mahkota&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Negeri-Negeri%20Supitan"&gt;Negeri-Negeri Supitan&lt;/a&gt; tepat telung wulan sadurunge &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Panas%201948"&gt;Olimpiade Musim Panas 1948&lt;/a&gt;. Nagara kasebut isih ngirimi tim menyang Permainan kasebut nganti taun &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Panas%201964"&gt;1964&lt;/a&gt; nalika Singapura dadi bagean saka &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, sing ngirim tim gabungan. Sawise kamerdikaan penuh Singapura saka Malaysia ing 1965, nagara kasebut isih melu ing kabeh edisi Olimpiade Musim Panas sabanjure kajaba ing taun &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Panas%201980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt; nalika nagara kasebut melu ing &lt;a href="pemboikotan%20Olimpiade%20Musim%20Panas%201980"&gt;pemboikotan Olimpiade&lt;/a&gt; gedhe. Singapura ngegawe debut &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Dingin"&gt;Olimpiade Musim Dingin&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Dingin%202018"&gt;Olimpiade Musim Dingin 2018&lt;/a&gt;.
