<doc id="183688" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183688" title="Lori Lightfoot">
Lori Lightfoot

Lori Elaine Lightfoot (#ALIH) yaiku jaksa lan pulitikus Amerika Sarekat sing ngejabat minangka &lt;a href="walikutha%20Chicago"&gt;walikutha Chicago&lt;/a&gt; ka-56 sawise 2019. Ia menika anggota &lt;a href="Parte%20Dhemokrat%20%28Amerika%20Sarekat%29"&gt;Parte Dhemokrat&lt;/a&gt;. Sadurunge dadi walikutha, Lightfoot bekerja ing praktek hukum swasta minangka mitra ing &lt;a href="Mayer%20Brown"&gt;Mayer Brown&lt;/a&gt; lan megang berbagai jabatan papréntahan ing Chicago. Ia ngejabat minangka presiden &lt;a href="Badan%20Kepolisian%20Chicago"&gt;Badan Kepolisian Chicago&lt;/a&gt; lan ketua &lt;a href="Chicago%20Police%20Accountability%20Task%20Force"&gt;Chicago Police Accountability Task Force&lt;/a&gt;. Lightfoot maju kanggo jabatan Walikutha Chicago ing &lt;a href="pemilihan%20umum%20walikota%20Chicago%202019"&gt;2019&lt;/a&gt;, ngelawan &lt;a href="Toni%20Preckwinkle"&gt;Toni Preckwinkle&lt;/a&gt; ing pemilu Februari 2019. Ia ngalahke Preckwinkle ing 2 April 2019.
Lightfoot menika wadon Afrika-Amerika lesbian terbuka pertami sing kapilih dadi walikutha saka kutha gedhe ing &lt;a href="Amerika%20Sarekat"&gt;Amerika Sarekat&lt;/a&gt;. Kajaba iku, ia menika wadon kaloro (sawise &lt;a href="Jane%20Byrne"&gt;Jane Byrne&lt;/a&gt;), lan Afrika-Amerika katelu—sawise &lt;a href="Harold%20Washington"&gt;Harold Washington&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Eugene%20Sawyer"&gt;Eugene Sawyer&lt;/a&gt;—sing dadi walikutha Chicago.
