<doc id="183716" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183716" title="Jungguk-naengmyeon">
Jungguk-naengmyeon

<ol>
<li>ALIH (&lt;a href="Basa%20Kor%C3%A9a"&gt;Koréa&lt;/a&gt;: 중국냉면, transl. Mi dingin Cina) iku jinis &lt;a href="naengmyeon"&gt;naengmyeon&lt;/a&gt; (mi dingin) ing &lt;a href="Olahan%20Korea%20China"&gt;masakan Cina Korea&lt;/a&gt;. Piring kasebut, sing kasusun saka duduh kaldu es karo mie, panganan laut blanched, sayuran seger, lan &lt;a href="Endhog%20godhog"&gt;endhog sing digodhog&lt;/a&gt;, biasane disuguhake karo &lt;a href="mustar"&gt;mustar&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Saos%20kacang"&gt;saus kacang&lt;/a&gt;.</<li>
</ol>
Duduh kaldu ayam biasane digunakake ing jungguk-naengmyeon. Duduh kaldu, sing dibumbui karo jahe, bawang bombay, lan anggur beras, disuguhake karo mie gandum lan topping gaya Cina. &lt;a href="Mustar"&gt;Mustard&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Saos%20kacang"&gt;saus kacang&lt;/a&gt; biasane ditambahake ing sajian. Saus kacang menehi sup sing kandel, werna krim, katon opaque lan rasa kacang. Topping sing umum kalebu irisan daging sing digodhog, panganan laut sing dicelupake kayata &lt;a href="Urang%20%28k%C3%A9wan%29"&gt;udang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Uwur-uwur%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;ubur&lt;/a&gt; -ubur, &lt;a href="Sotong%20umum"&gt;sotong&lt;/a&gt;, sayuran kayata &lt;a href="timun"&gt;timun&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Wortel%20jangan"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt; sing diiris tipis, lan &lt;a href="tomat"&gt;tomat&lt;/a&gt;, uga &lt;a href="Endhog%20godhog"&gt;endhog sing digodhog&lt;/a&gt;.
