Provinsi geejawi.
&lt;a href="Provinsi%20grejawi"&gt;Provinsi grejawi&lt;/a&gt;-ne isih nduweni &lt;a href="biskop%20suffragan"&gt;tahta-tahta suffragan&lt;/a&gt;
