&lt;a href="Vietnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt; miwiti melu ing &lt;a href="Permainan%20Olimpiade"&gt;Permainan Olimpiade&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Vietnam%20ing%20Olimpiade%201952"&gt;1952&lt;/a&gt; minangka &lt;a href="Nagara%20Vietnam"&gt;Nagara Vietnam&lt;/a&gt;. sawise &lt;a href="pemisahan%20Vietnam"&gt;pemisahan Vietnam&lt;/a&gt; ing 1954, mung &lt;a href="Vietnam%20Kidul"&gt;Republik Vietnam&lt;/a&gt; sing berkompetisi ing Permainan kasebut, ngirim para atlit kanggo kabeh Olimpiade Musim Panas saka &lt;a href="Vietnam%20ing%20Olimpiade%20Musim%20Panas%201956"&gt;1956&lt;/a&gt; nganti &lt;a href="Vietnam%20ing%20Olimpiade%20Musim%20Panas%201972"&gt;1972&lt;/a&gt;.
Sawise reunifikasi Vietnam ing taun 1976, nagara kasebut melu minangka Republik Sosialis Vietnam, melu ing kabeh Olimpiade sawise &lt;a href="Vietnam%20ing%20Olimpiade%20Musim%20Panas%201980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt; lan sabanjure karo pengecualian &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Panas%201984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt;. Komite Olimpiade Vietnam saiki didegake ing 1976 lan ditrima dening &lt;a href="International%20Olympic%20Committee"&gt;International Olympic Committee&lt;/a&gt; (IOC) ing 1979. Vietnam ora pernah berkompetisi ing &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Dingin"&gt;Olimpiade Musim Dingin&lt;/a&gt;.
