<doc id="183827" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183827" title="Kabiskopan Agung Astana">
Kabiskopan Agung Astana

Kabiskopan Agung Bunda Maria Teramat Suci ing &lt;a href="Astana"&gt;Astana&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Archidioecesis Sanctae Mariae in Astanansis, &lt;a href="Basa%20Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt;: Архиепархия Пресвятой Девы Марии в Астане) yaiku &lt;a href="kabiskopan%20agung"&gt;kabiskopan agung&lt;/a&gt; Latin &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik%20Roma"&gt;Greja Katulik Roma&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Kazakhstan"&gt;Kazakhstan&lt;/a&gt;. Tahta episkopal &lt;a href="katedral"&gt;katedral&lt;/a&gt;e yaiku &lt;a href="Katedral%20Bunda%20Penolong%20Abadi%2C%20Astana"&gt;Katedral Bunda Penolong Abadi&lt;/a&gt;, ing ibu kutha &lt;a href="Nursultan"&gt;Nursultan&lt;/a&gt; (biyen Astana).
<h2>Kronologi</h2>
<ul>
<li>Didegake minangka Administrasi Apostolik Astana ing 7 Juli 1999, misah saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Karaganda"&gt;Administrasi Apostolik Kazakhstan&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Ditingkatake dadi Kabiskopan Agung Bunda Maria Teramat Suci ing Astana ing 17 Mei 2003</li>
</ul>
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
&lt;a href="Paus%20Yohanes%20Paulus%20II"&gt;Paus Yohanes Paulus II&lt;/a&gt; ngadegake administrasi apostolik ing &lt;a href="Nursultan"&gt;Astana&lt;/a&gt; (saiki Nursultan) ing 7 Juli 1999 kanthi misahkene saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Karaganda"&gt;Administrasi Apostolik Kazakhstan&lt;/a&gt; (banjur kuwi dadi Kabiskopan Karaganda) lan ngunjungine ing September 2001. Banjur kuwi, Paus Yohanes Paulus II ningkatke wilayah kasebut dadi kabiskopan agung ing 17 Mei 2003.
<h2>Provinsi grejawi</h2>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Karaganda"&gt;Kabiskopan Karaganda&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Almaty"&gt;Kabiskopan Tritunggal Mahakudus ing Almaty&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Administrasi%20Apostolik%20Atyrau"&gt;Administrasi Apostolik Atyrau&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
<h2>Ordinaris</h2>
<h3>Administrator Apostolik Astana</h3>
<ul>
<li>Rm. Tomasz Bernard Peta (7 Juli 1999 – 17 Mei 2003, dadi Biskop Agung Astana), &lt;a href="Biskop%20tituler"&gt;biskop Tituler&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Benda%2C%20Albania"&gt;Benda&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
<h3>Biskop Agung Astana</h3>
<ul>
<li>Tomasz Bernard Peta (17 Mei 2003 – saiki)</li>
<ul>
<li>Biskop Auksilier: Athanasius Schneider, &lt;a href="Kanon%20Reguler%20Salib%20Suci%20Coimbra"&gt;O.R.C.&lt;/a&gt; (5 Februari 2011 – saiki), Uskup Tituler &lt;a href="Celerina%20%28tahta%29"&gt;Celerina&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
</ul>
