<doc id="183829" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183829" title="Kabiskopan Karaganda">
Kabiskopan Karaganda

Kabiskopan Karaganda (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Dioecesis Karagandansis, &lt;a href="Basa%20Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt;: Карагандинская епархия,) yaiku &lt;a href="kabiskopan"&gt;kabiskopan&lt;/a&gt; Latin &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik"&gt;Greja Katulik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="suffragan"&gt;suffragan&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="provinsi%20grejawi"&gt;provinsi grejawi&lt;/a&gt; Metropolitan &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung%20Astana"&gt;Kabiskopan Agung Astana&lt;/a&gt;. Tahta episkopal katedrale menika Katedral &lt;a href="Bunda%20saka%20Fatima"&gt;Bunda saka Fatima&lt;/a&gt;, ing kutha &lt;a href="Karaganda"&gt;Karaganda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kazakhstan"&gt;Kazakhstan&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan Karganda uga nduweni bekas katedral sing sadurunge menika tahta episkopal sadurunge dipindahke menyang Katedral Bunda saka Fatima, yaiku ing Katedral St. Yosef.
