<doc id="183865" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183865" title="Zosui">
Zosui

Sup zosui minangka olahan sop saka Jepang saka sisa &lt;a href="Nabemono"&gt;nabe&lt;/a&gt; asring digunakake maneh kanggo zosui. Ora nganggo beras, &lt;a href="udon"&gt;udon&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ram%C3%A8n"&gt;mi ramen minangka&lt;/a&gt; alternatif anyar.
Ana sawetara varietas zōsui, kalebu maru zōsui (まる雑炊, maru zōsui) (digawe nganggo kura-kura kulit alus Cina), &lt;a href="fugu"&gt;fugu&lt;/a&gt; zōsui (ふぐ雑炊, &lt;a href="fugu"&gt;fugu&lt;/a&gt; zōsui), kani zōsui (かに雑炊, kani zōsui) tori zōsui (とり雑炊, tori zōsui) (digawe nganggo &lt;a href="pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt; () (digawe nganggo &lt;a href="Kepithing"&gt;yuyu&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="sukiyaki"&gt;sukiyaki&lt;/a&gt; zōsui (すきやき雑炊, &lt;a href="sukiyaki"&gt;sukiyaki&lt;/a&gt; zōsui), lan &lt;a href="shabu-shabu"&gt;shabu-shabu&lt;/a&gt; zōsui (しゃぶしゃぶ雑炊, &lt;a href="shabu-shabu"&gt;shabu-shabu&lt;/a&gt; zōsui). Kanggo &lt;a href="Olah-olah"&gt;masakan omah&lt;/a&gt;, sisa duduh kaldu lan beras digabungake karo bahan apa wae sing ana ing tangan.
