<h3>Lower Saxony</h3>
Lower Saxony.
Lower saxony nglapuraké, menawa laladané nandang kasus virus korona kapisan ing 1 Maret 2020.
<h3>Saarland</h3>
Saarland.
Saarland nglapuraké, menawa laladané nandang kasus virus korona kapisan ing 3 Maret 2020.
<h3>Saxony</h3>
Saxony.
Saxony nglapuraké, menawa laladané nandang kasus virus korona kapisan ing 3 Maret 2020.
<h3>Schleswig-Holstein</h3>
Schleswig-Holstein.
Schleswig-Holstein nglapuraké, menawa laladané nandang virus korona kapisan ing 28 Fèbruari 2020.
<h3>Thuringia</h3>
Thuringia.
