Mamata Banerjee (&lt;a href="Basa%20Bengali"&gt;Bengali&lt;/a&gt;: Mamata Bandyopadhyay; #ALIH) yaiku pulitikus Indhi sing ngejabat minangka ketuwa mentri praja &lt;a href="Bengal%20Kulon"&gt;Bengal Kulon&lt;/a&gt; kasanga sawise 20 Mei 2011, ngedadike dhèwèké dadi wadon kapisan sing megang jabatan kasebut. Ngejabat kaping pirang-pirang minangka Mentri Kabinet, Mamata Banerjee dadi Ketuwa Mentri Bengal Kulon kanggo kaping pisan ing 2011. Ia ngadegake &lt;a href="Kongres%20Trinamool%20Kabeh%20Indhi"&gt;Kongres Trinamool Kabeh Indhi&lt;/a&gt; (AITC utawa TMC) ing 1998 sabanjure metu saka &lt;a href="Kongres%20Nasional%20Indhi"&gt;Kongres Nasional Indhi&lt;/a&gt;, lan dadi ketuwa kapisane. Ia asring diarani minangka 'Didi' (artine saudari tuwa ing &lt;a href="basa%20Bengali"&gt;Bengali&lt;/a&gt;).
