<doc id="183999" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183999" title="Soong kakang-adhi">
Soong kakang-adhi

Soong kakang-adhi (&lt;a href="Tionghoa%20Tradisional"&gt;Tionghoa Tradisional&lt;/a&gt;: 宋家姐妹, &lt;a href="pinyin"&gt;pinyin&lt;/a&gt;: Sòngjiā Jiěmèi, utawa 宋氏三姐妹) yaiku telu wadon Tiongkok &lt;a href="orang%20Hakka"&gt;Hakka&lt;/a&gt; sing, bebarengan karo garwa-garwane, dadi figur pulitik ing &lt;a href="Tiongkok"&gt;Tiongkok&lt;/a&gt; sing paling signifikan ing wiwit abad ka-20. Mereka mainke peran utami ing ngepengaruhke garwa-garwa mereka, sing bebarengan karo posisi kekuwatan mereka dhewe, ngobah &lt;a href="sajarah%20Tiongkok"&gt;sajarah Tiongkok&lt;/a&gt;.
Ramane menika pandhita &lt;a href="Methodis"&gt;Methodis&lt;/a&gt; didikan Amerika &lt;a href="Charlie%20Soong"&gt;Charlie Soong&lt;/a&gt;, sing nggawe peruntungan ing bidang perbankan lan percetakan. Ibune menika &lt;a href="Ni%20Kwei-tseng"&gt;Ni Kwei-tseng&lt;/a&gt; (倪桂珍 Ní Guìzhēn), sing menika katurunan matematikawan &lt;a href="Dinasti%20Ming"&gt;Dinasti Ming&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sarekat%20Yesus"&gt;Yesuit&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Xu%20Guangqi"&gt;Xu Guangqi&lt;/a&gt;. Kabeh telung kakang-adhi nempuh pendidikan ing &lt;a href="Wesleyan%20College"&gt;Wesleyan College&lt;/a&gt; ing Macon, Georgia, Amerika Sarekat. Nanging, Mei-Ling minggalke Wesleyan College lan banjur kuwi lulus saka &lt;a href="Wellesley%20College"&gt;Wellesley College&lt;/a&gt; ing Wellesley, Massachusetts. Telu saudara mereka menika pejabat berpangkat dhuwur ing papréntahan &lt;a href="Republik%20Tiongkok"&gt;Republik Tiongkok&lt;/a&gt;, salah sijine yaiku &lt;a href="T.%20V.%20Soong"&gt;T. V. Soong&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Telung kakang-adhi</h2>
Telung kakang-adhi.
Pernikahan lan motivasi mereka dikandani dening Maois "Sing siji tresnani dhuwit, sing siji tresnani kekuatan, sing sijine tresnani nagarane" (&lt;a href="basa%20Tionghoa"&gt;Tionghoa&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="wikt%3A%E4%B8%80%E5%80%8B%E6%84%9B%E9%8C%A2%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E5%80%8B%E6%84%9B%E6%AC%8A%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E5%80%8B%E6%84%9B%E5%9C%8B"&gt;一個愛錢、一個愛權、一個愛國&lt;/a&gt;; &lt;a href="Pinyin"&gt;Pinyin&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="wikt%3AY%C4%ABg%C3%A8%20%C3%A0i%20qi%C3%A1n%2C%20y%C4%ABg%C3%A8%20%C3%A0i%20qu%C3%A1n%2C%20y%C4%ABg%C3%A8%20%C3%A0igu%C3%B3"&gt;Yīgè ài qián, yīgè ài quán, yīgè àiguó&lt;/a&gt;) sing ngacu karo Ai-ling, May-ling, lan Ching-ling.
