<doc id="184111" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=184111" title="Hilda Heine">
Hilda Heine

Hilda Cathy Heine (#ALIH) yaiku pengajar lan pulitikus Kapuloan Marshall, sing ngejabat minangka &lt;a href="Presidhen%20Kapuloan%20Marshall"&gt;Presidhen Kapuloan Marshall&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pratelan%20Presidhen%20Kapuloan%20Marshall"&gt;kawolu&lt;/a&gt;. Sadurunge megang jabatan, ia ngejabat minangka Mantri Pendidikan. Ia menika wong kapisan ing &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Marshall"&gt;Kapuloan Marshall&lt;/a&gt; sing diwenehi &lt;a href="gelar%20dokterandes"&gt;gelar dokterandes&lt;/a&gt;, lan pangadeg kelompok hak wadon Women United Together Marshall Islands (WUTMI).
Heine menika wadon kapisan sing megang kepresidenan Kapuloan Marshall. Ia uga dadi presiden wadon kapisan saka nagara &lt;a href="Mikronesia"&gt;Mikronesia&lt;/a&gt;, lan wadon kapapan sing ngejabat minangka &lt;a href="kepala%20papr%C3%A9ntahan"&gt;kepala papréntahan&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nagara independen ing &lt;a href="Oseania"&gt;Oseania&lt;/a&gt; (sawise &lt;a href="Jenny%20Shipley"&gt;Jenny Shipley&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Helen%20Clark"&gt;Helen Clark&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Niu%20Selan"&gt;Niu Selan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Julia%20Gillard"&gt;Julia Gillard&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Ostrali&lt;/a&gt;). Ia menika salah siji saka mung telu wadon sing saiki ngejabat ing &lt;a href="Legislatur%20Kapuloan%20Marshall"&gt;Nitijeļā&lt;/a&gt;, legislatur nagara kasebut, ing Januari 2016.
